{"title":"Art of Problem Solving","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Art of Problem Solving</b> (<b>AoPS</b>) is an educational resources company founded by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a> in 2003.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Mission\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mission</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Tradition_of_Excellence\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tradition of Excellence</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Staff\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Staff</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Programs\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Programs</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Online\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Online</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Online_School\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Online School</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Beast_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Beast Academy</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Resources</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Wiki\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Wiki</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Books</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Subject_textbooks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Subject textbooks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Competition_preparation_books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Competition preparation books</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Other_math_books\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other math books</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#AoPS_Community\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AoPS Community</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Contest_Collections\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contest Collections</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Alcumus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alcumus</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#MATHCOUNTS_Trainer\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">MATHCOUNTS Trainer</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#For_the_Win!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">For the Win!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#LaTeX_Resources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">LaTeX Resources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Articles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Articles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#Philanthropy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Philanthropy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#External_Links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External Links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mission\">Mission</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Mission\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The main goal of AoPS is to create interactive educational opportunities for avid students of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">mathematics</a>, specifically focusing <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_problem_solving\" title=\"Mathematical problem solving\">mathematical problem solving</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">mathematics competitions</a>. As time goes on, AoPS is also reaching out to students of other <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Problem_solving\" title=\"Problem solving\">problem solving</a> disciplines, including <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science\" title=\"Science\">science</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Informatics\" title=\"Informatics\">informatics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_programming\" title=\"Computer programming\">computer programming</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Language_arts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Language arts (page does not exist)\">language arts</a> and other subjects.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tradition_of_Excellence\">Tradition of Excellence</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Tradition of Excellence\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The accomplishments of every student are unique, and there is no way to measure that success.  However, we try to record and celebrate <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Community_Awards\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS Community Awards\">achievements of AoPS students, faculty, and community members</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Staff\">Staff</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Staff\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a list of all the current staff at AoPS and some previous staff go to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Administrators\" title=\"AoPS Administrators\">AoPS Administrators</a> page.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Programs\">Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Online\">AoPS Online</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Online\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Online_School\">AoPS Online School</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Online School\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Online_School\" title=\"AoPS Online School\">AoPS Online School</a> hosts math classes primarily for bright middle and high school students. Students of the online math school include winners of nearly every major mathematics competition in the U.S.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Academy\">AoPS Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Academy&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"AoPS Academy (page does not exist)\">AoPS Academy</a> is an in-person program which teaches <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">mathematics</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Language_arts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Language arts (page does not exist)\">language arts</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science\" title=\"Science\">science</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Beast_Academy\">Beast Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Beast Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a> is a program originally created for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Elementary_school&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Elementary school (page does not exist)\">elementary school</a> students.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A list of resources on AoPS can be found <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/resources\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Wiki\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>You're in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> now!\n</p><p>Its contents include:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Table_of_Contents\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Table of Contents\">AoPS Wiki:Table of Contents</a>, a basic guide to AoPS Wiki content</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competitions</a>, including a huge <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">list of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_resources\" title=\"Academic resources\">Academic resources</a>, including <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">math books</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a> including a large list of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">mathematics scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Books\">Books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Subject_textbooks\">Subject textbooks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Subject textbooks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>AoPS subject texts provide instruction to excellent mathematics students. This modern curriculum is comprehensive and challenging enough for brilliant young mathematical minds.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/prealgebra\">Prealgebra</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intro-algebra\">Introduction to Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intro-counting\">Introduction to Counting &amp; Probability</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intro-geometry\">Introduction to Geometry</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intro-number-theory\">Introduction to Number Theory</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intermediate-algebra\">Intermediate Algebra</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/intermediate-counting\">Intermediate Counting &amp; Probability</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/precalculus\">Precalculus</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/calculus\">Calculus</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Competition_preparation_books\">Competition preparation books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Competition preparation books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>The Art of Problem Solving competition preparation books cover various topics of interest to students of mathematics interested in competitive math.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/aops-vol1\">Art of Problem Solving Volume 1: The Basics</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/aops-vol2\">Art of Problem Solving Volume 2: and Beyond</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/item/competition-math\">Competition Math for Middle School</a></li></ul>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_math_books\">Other math books</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Other math books\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>AoPS sells numerous other math books at the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store\">AoPS Bookstore</a>.  Many of these books focus on competitions such as the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AMC\">AMC</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mandelbrot_Competition\" title=\"Mandelbrot Competition\">Mandelbrot Competition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MOEMS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MOEMS\">MOEMS</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AoPS_Community\">AoPS Community</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: AoPS Community\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community\">AoPS Community</a> is where students and problem solvers of all ages can discuss mathematics and problem-solving.  Visit <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Community\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Community\">AoPS Wiki:Community</a> for more details.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contest_Collections\">Contest Collections</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Contest Collections\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>AoPS members help organize a large and well-organized <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">list of problems and solutions</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">mathematics competitions</a> all over the world.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alcumus\">Alcumus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Alcumus\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alcumus\" title=\"Alcumus\">Alcumus</a> is a resource that can be used to practice competition math problems.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MATHCOUNTS_Trainer\">MATHCOUNTS Trainer</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: MATHCOUNTS Trainer\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS_Trainer&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS Trainer (page does not exist)\">MATHCOUNTS Trainer</a> is similar to Alcumus, but its questions are entirely from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"For_the_Win.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"For_the_Win!\">For the Win!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: For the Win!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=For_The_Win\" title=\"For The Win\">For The Win</a> is an online interactive game for students to participate in activities similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MATHCOUNTS\" title=\"MATHCOUNTS\">MATHCOUNTS</a> Countdown Round.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"LaTeX_Resources\">LaTeX Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: LaTeX Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TeXeR\" title=\"TeXeR\">TeXeR</a> is a sandbox for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX\" title=\"LaTeX\">LaTeX</a> code. The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community\">AoPS Forums</a> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX\" title=\"LaTeX\">LaTeX</a>-enabled, allowing users to post nice mathematics.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Articles\">Articles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" title=\"Edit section: Articles\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>AoPS resources include <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/blog\">numerous amazing articles</a> for students, parents, and teachers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Philanthropy\">Philanthropy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"Edit section: Philanthropy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Many features of the Art of Problem Solving website are made available for free so that every student interested in mathematics can use them.\n</p><p>Additionally, AoPS instructors provide hundreds of hours of teaching and support time for the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle\" title=\"San Diego Math Circle\">San Diego Math Circle</a>.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Initiative\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving Initiative\">Art of Problem Solving Initiative</a> is a nonprofit corporation founded by former AoPS CEO <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a> with largely the same fundamental mission as AoPS itself but with a greater focus on providing educational resources where they are lacking. AoPS donates a portion of its book and class sales to the foundation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=23\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Community\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Community\">AoPS Wiki:Community</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit&amp;section=24\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com\">Official website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//artofproblemsolving.org\">AoPS Initiative</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community\">AoPS Community</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072128\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 180/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 927/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.950      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    7.950      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1444:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072128 and revision id 273077. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}